{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Ambrose was a revered Praunus, a wise and powerful being with the body of a man and the claws of a crab. He dwelled in the crystal caves beneath the ocean's surface, where he spent centuries mastering the ancient art of shell magic. Ambrose's lair was a sanctuary for lost sea creatures, who sought his guidance and protection. With his shell-encrusted staff, he could communicate with the creatures of the deep and wield the power of the tides. As a guardian of the ocean's secrets, Ambrose was fiercely dedicated to maintaining the delicate balance of the marine ecosystem. His wisdom and magical prowess earned him the respect of merfolk and sea gods alike, who sought his counsel in times of turmoil.",
